  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto is currently pursuing a wide range of international partnerships aimed at bolstering Indonesia's economic and technological standing. Recent developments include the formalization of trade and investment agreements with the European Union, alongside bilateral cooperation with the United States for small-scale nuclear reactor development. Cooperation efforts also extend to clean energy initiatives with South Korea, focusing on large-scale solar power potential, and waste management strategies with the Netherlands as part of international climate discussions. These moves coincide with broader regional efforts, as the President has used platforms like APEC to advocate for increased innovation, transparency, and collective prosperity across Southeast Asia. Domestically, these initiatives are complemented by corporate partnerships within the energy and visual media sectors, reflecting a multifaceted strategy to integrate Indonesia further into the global economy through sustainable and diversified infrastructure and commercial frameworks.",
